{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"36fa929663b7e8e3b4dcc2b7bddca57da18cc5bea20cfd16f6e1beb2779722bf","ja":"うーん、ここのがいいのかなあ……？","zh":"嗯……选这里的会比较好吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0fbfda7da3ead5b2c6c4b52e08bcc0c830d8b6e56d4f009816261b73b58dcb58","ja":"歩さん！　もしかしてそのうどん屋さん、\n気になってるんですか？","zh":"步小姐！难道你对那家乌冬面店\n很感兴趣吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4a5b710d45448b964ef515947a00b237296b0baa22ed7083a2c8fefe9b48612b","ja":"え……し、静香……！？\nえっと……その……。","zh":"诶……静、静香……！？\n那个……这个嘛……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"dbef7d4b096ec2c692767be7c27004acc1790c5b1839370ba3c448abc8949486","ja":"私もちょうどお昼を食べようかなって、考えてた\nところなんです。よかったら今から一緒に……。","zh":"我也正好在考虑要不要吃午饭呢。\n不介意的话，现在要不要一起……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fb16f6d029e6fdca7b0e3ecf57316821466725da1bbacfc4aa01e84c3e22e766","ja":"いや、アタシは……。","zh":"不，我……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"18fba6b432787408b56caec07ca5da046cad2de8ed24fb2358e8ad294d72faf6","ja":"……？　どうしたんです……？","zh":"……？　怎么了吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d85a083f23d3dc9a37c0c5a7d6aa528c1601683d810c66b3bff5f6ca32f2a06a","ja":"……ご、ごめん！\nちょっと急いでるから……！","zh":"……抱、抱歉！\n我现在有点赶时间……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"499d2e7b580ca7e0785808f2f105b08d11b09517f6f97226071a19b187612504","ja":"……えっ。ええ～～～っ！？","zh":"……诶。诶诶～～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481","ja":"翌日……","zh":"隔天……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"37c6b1c85032ac349b8ac1e461e332d97c61899fbfa98aa82c62ffe756aa37b6","ja":"……ということがあったんです。なんだか歩さん、\nすっごく忙しそうで、ソワソワしていて……。","zh":"……事情大概就是这样。总觉得步她\n好像特别忙，整个人都静不下心来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"7e33a44e420091fc438c49c386bcab3626d4746fcc1ea2bb5306cba55c28d1e7","ja":"あのうどん屋さんの\nコシがあって、ツルツルとした舌触りの麺……。","zh":"那家乌冬面店\n劲道又爽滑的面条……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"5c0e9dc358e449b859a18997d4be7ba41f62a80fac3d79461e4812b925224408","ja":"それに、かつおだしの旨味が堪能できるおつゆに、\n甘いおあげも……ぜひ味わってほしかったのに！","zh":"而且，明明很想让你也尝尝\n那能尽情品味鲣鱼高汤鲜美的高汤汤汁，还有甜甜的油炸豆腐皮的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"2ce872c095d581841c8377e4c2f7a793e66f97e362592d586339d1599e6db303","ja":"な、なんだか聞いてるだけで、\nお腹空いてきちゃった……。","zh":"光、光是听着，\n肚子就饿起来了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"2c678e89e6b1e7cc54a48a620b89411b6adf9e718085dc8194297193a937d222","ja":"でも、このごろの歩さん、なんか変だよね？\nわたしもね、この前お店で会ったの！","zh":"不过，步最近是不是有点怪怪的？\n我也在不久前去店里时遇到她了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"67f02b1a3496c8b5c1758882bd707981de9f8d9cdcbc3c18bd4f8a041114dfcd","ja":"魔法少女の限定ショップにいたから、お話ししようと\n思ったのに……すぐいなくなっちゃった。","zh":"因为在魔法少女的期间限定店看到了她，本来想和她聊聊的……\n结果一下子就不见了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"862fbfb0d57fbfb494d2196b2f159ae9458362947729212e3aa0d906d3724456","ja":"わ、私も……アロマのお店で……\n同じようなことが……。","zh":"我、我也……在香薰店里……\n遇到过类似的事……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"61b613709f55ab3d771d5938c873064c6d032674099b4a159518fb9a9a4d614b","ja":"みんなも？　ミキもお気に入りのメイク見てたら\n歩と会ったことあるよ。でもすぐ逃げられちゃったの。","zh":"大家也是吗？美希也曾经在看心仪的彩妆时\n遇到过步哦。不过马上就被她逃掉了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"bda4da14e11ec63f29e111d5d80c7f1e84eb0ac61316e80969f8d1466ebd86e9","ja":"な、何か……事情があるのかな……？","zh":"是有……什么隐情吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"2852bd96251aabac989c2d458cdb433ebac703a018af26621ee36ace7de7aac5","ja":"むー……ミキ、\nすっごく気になってきちゃったの。","zh":"唔……美希，\n变得超级在意了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1065.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"8682a51ea52c077bb32ec851eeb066eb63c58f09c5f03946552f270add5919e1","ja":"こうなったら、本人に問い詰めちゃお☆","zh":"既然这样，就去向本人问个究竟吧☆","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
